			"customizationId": "monkm",
			"height": 190,
			"weight": 170,
			"backgroundStory": "He was never particularly good at being a monk. Too restless for meditation and too fond of slipping beyond the Sect walls, he earned more lectures than praise.. At least until someone put him in front of a training post. With his fists, everything came naturally. By nineteen, he was already considered one of his sect's finest young disciples, and he made no secret of his ambition: one day, everyone beneath heaven would know his name. His masters usually answered that declaration by assigning him another hour of sweeping.\r\n\r\nThen the sect burned. By dawn, the halls where he'd grown up were gone, along with most of the people who had raised, scolded, trained, and believed in him. He escaped with only a handful of others, got separated and was left with nowhere to return to. He still intends to become famous, he'll tell anyone that much with the same confident grin as before. He just doesn't mention that now, when the world finally learns his name, he hopes they'll remember the name of his sect with it.",
			"refuseText": "Go sweep the floor first...",
			"acceptText": "Then show us what you can do!",
			"joinText": "Master, I'm Bai Yuanyi! Someday everyone will know my name, and my old sect's name too. Take me in, you won't regret it!",
